<title>GERMANY: Leica Q3 net profit 3.0 mln dmk vs 0.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Leica Q3 net profit 3.0 mln dmk vs 0.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SOLMS, Germany 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to December 31, third quarter of 1996/1997 fiscal year</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   3.0     vs 0.5</p>
<p>    Earnings before interest and tax     5.7     vs 2.1</p>
<p>    Net sales				    76.3    vs 66.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German camera maker is Leica Camera AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
